{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a math-fantasy world where the world itself is a maze and knots are law and power, you are an error in the system. To survive and find the truth, you keep untying the maze.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use simple rope actions\u2014drag, tie, tighten, loosen, undo\u2014to interact with the environment and advance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress is collection and build driven. Obtain new knots, weapons, equipment, and relics to change rope properties and puzzle options. The maze is procedurally generated, reshaping paths and goals each run. Surreal visuals depict geometric labyrinths and tactile rope. You will meet guardians and anomalies, but the focus remains on untying and moving forward.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4100370?t=1771855575","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4100370?t=1771855575","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4100370/d79c0ce1a56e54062c70eeea3654805507b6f155/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771855575","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4100370/d79c0ce1a56e54062c70eeea3654805507b6f155/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771855575","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a math-fantasy world where the world itself is a maze and knots are law and power, you are an error in the system. To survive and find the truth, you keep untying the maze.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use simple rope actions\u2014drag, tie, tighten, loosen, undo\u2014to interact with the environment and advance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress is collection and build driven. Obtain new knots, weapons, equipment, and relics to change rope properties and puzzle options. The maze is procedurally generated, reshaping paths and goals each run. Surreal visuals depict geometric labyrinths and tactile rope. You will meet guardians and anomalies, but the focus remains on untying and moving forward.</p>","developers":["P.F.J."],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4100370/4b14d33ce084b511f13638fb3c5305ecb999323d/header.jpg?t=1771855575","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> OSX 10.13<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual Core 2 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 1 GB GPU<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Any</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> OSX 10.13<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 1 GB GPU<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Any</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4100370/823876491/c9ef358a4d774db510fa6c6aa430b7dca52ce607/1761234358/dash_av1.mpd?t=1761234828","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4100370/823876491/c9ef358a4d774db510fa6c6aa430b7dca52ce607/1761234358/dash_h264.mpd?t=1761234828","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.a